WEBVTT

00:06:29.756 --> 00:06:32.756
Their standard of living is very, very low

00:06:32.756 --> 00:06:37.196
because all the wealth and power
is kind of sucked

00:06:37.236 --> 00:06:39.276
by the people at the top,

00:06:39.316 --> 00:06:42.196
and very little is left
for everybody else.

00:06:42.556 --> 00:06:46.036
So I don't think it's a society

00:06:46.036 --> 00:06:52.036
where the masses are part
of this kind of ideological project.

00:06:52.396 --> 00:06:54.516
They're being ruled from the top.

00:06:54.836 --> 00:06:59.116
And you have this classic
imperial situation,

00:06:59.116 --> 00:07:01.036
when the emperor,